# Implementation Plan: Base44 Web App Strategic Alignment

This plan outlines the UI enhancements for the `sovereign-ui` project (the Admin Command Center) to reflect the recent Base44 cognitive optimizations.

## User Review Required

> [!TIP]
> This will add a live "Cloud Bridge" status indicator to the dashboard, matching the newly implemented backend monitor.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component: UI Navigation & Metrics]

#### [MODIFY] [App.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/sovereign-ui/src/App.tsx)
- Add a `bridgeStatus` state to the main App component.
- Listen for the `bridge_status` or `system_metrics` socket events (depending on the final telemetry payload).
- Implement a **"Signal Compression Dashboard"** section in the main layout.

### [Component: Status Indicators]

#### [MODIFY] [QuantumParameterTuner.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/sovereign-ui/src/components/QuantumParameterTuner.tsx)
- Integrate the **Cloud Resonance** indicator (Online/Offline) next to the Coherence metric.
- Display real-time **Bridge Latency** (ms) from the Base44 health check.

#### [NEW] [SignalDensityMonitor.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/sovereign-ui/src/components/SignalDensityMonitor.tsx)
- Create a visualization for the **Semantic Compression Ratio** achieved by Gemini 3.
- Show "Raw Signal" vs "Compressed Signal" throughput.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- Run the `sovereign-ui` dev server and verify Socket.IO message reception using a mock emitter.

### Manual Verification
- Launch [LAUNCH_SOVEREIGN_CORE.bat](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/scripts/launchers/LAUNCH_SOVEREIGN_CORE.bat).
- Open `http://localhost:5174` and verify the "Cloud Bridge" indicator reflects the [.env.local](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/.env.local) health.
